ar on both sides, the first and last page numbers stay in those menus; the icon buttons still jump to those pages. Three-digit page numbers expand to fit."},"2762":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-21","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#more-pages","content":"The preview's Code tab includes its page-range calculation. The calculation stays outside the Pagination primitive."},"2763":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-22","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#first-last-and-disabled-controls","content":"PaginationFirst and PaginationLast follow the same API as PaginationPrevious and PaginationNext. Place each in a PaginationItem."},"2764":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-23","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#first-last-and-disabled-controls","content":"Use disabled to block click and middle-click activation and remove a control from the tab order. A disabled default anchor also loses its href and retains its link semantics with aria-disabled. Setting only aria-disabled forwards that attribute without blocking activation."},"2765":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-24","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#states","content":"With a single page, every directional control is disabled. In a right-to-left layout, the directional icons mirror."},"2766":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-25","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"Directional controls show icons by default. Supply children for a visible label and aria-label to localise the accessible name."},"2767":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-26","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"Compose a router link through render; Pagination keeps link semantics. For example, with Next.js:"},"2768":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-27","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"The single-row table footer is the Table Pagination block. It places these page controls beside a page jump and a rows-per-page select. When the row is too narrow, the jump field and the page-size select hide."},"2769":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-28","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"To build a different footer, combine these parts with Input and Select. Validate page bounds, and update the page when the page size or result count changes in your screen's state."},"2770":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-29","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#pagination-paginationcontent-and-paginationitem","content":"These render nav, ul, and li respectively, forward native props and refs, and accept className. Pagination defaults to aria-label=\"pagination\"; give each navigation landmark a distinct label when a page contains multiple paginators."},"2771":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-30","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Prop"},"2772":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-31","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Type"},"2773":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-32","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Default"},"2774":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-33","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Description"},"2775":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-34","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"href"},"2776":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-35","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"string"},"2777":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-36","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"—"},"2778":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-37","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Destination for the default anchor"},"2779":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-38","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"isActive"},"2780":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-39","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"boolean"},"2781":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-40","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"false"},"2782":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-41","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Highlights the page and sets aria-current=\"page\""},"2783":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-42","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"disabled"},"2784":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-43","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"boolean"},"2785":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-44","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"false"},"2786":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-45","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Blocks clicks, removes the control from tab order, and omits the default anchor's href"},"2787":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-46","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"render"},"2788":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-47","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"ReactElement | render function"},"2789":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-48","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"—"},"2790":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-49","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Composes a router link or native button"},"2791":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-50","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"children"},"2792":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-51","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"ReactNode"},"2793":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-52","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"—"},"2794":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-53","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Page number or custom content"},"2795":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-54","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"className"},"2796":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-55","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"string"},"2797":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-56","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"—"},"2798":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-57","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Additional CSS classes"},"2799":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-58","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"...props"},"2800":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-59","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Anchor props"},"2801":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-60","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"—"},"2802":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-61","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Native attributes, events, and ref"},"2803":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-62","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#directional-controls","content":"PaginationFirst, PaginationPrevious, PaginationNext, and PaginationLast accept PaginationLink props. Each provides an icon and a default accessible name such as “Go to next page”. Use children for an optional visible label and aria-label to override the accessible name. Directional icons mirror in RTL layouts."},"2804":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-63","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#paginationellipsis","content":"Renders a button that opens a menu of the omitted pages. pages is the list of page numbers in that gap. onPageSelect runs when a menu item is chosen. A string children replaces the accessible name, which defaults to “More pages”. The visible control stays the ellipsis icon."},"2805":{"id":"/docs/components/pagination-64","page_id":"/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/pagination#data-slots","content":"Each public part has a stable slot: pagination, pagination-content, pagination-item, pagination-link, pagination-first, pagination-previous, pagination-next, pagination-last, and pagination-ellipsis."},"2806":{"id":"/docs/components/popover","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"page","content":"Popover","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover"},"2807":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-0","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover","content":"A floating panel anchored to a trigger element, used for tooltips with rich content, profile cards, and contextual overlays."},"2808":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-1","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#preview","content":"Preview"},"2809":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-2","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#usage","content":"Usage"},"2810":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-3","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#placement","content":"Placement"},"2811":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-4","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#rich-content","content":"Rich Content"},"2812":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-5","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#multiple-triggers","content":"Multiple Triggers"},"2813":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-6","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#custom-anchor","content":"Custom Anchor"},"2814":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-7","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#portal-container","content":"Portal Container"},"2815":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-8","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"When to Use"},"2816":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-9","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#props","content":"Props"},"2817":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-10","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"PopoverContent"},"2818":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-11","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover#exports","content":"Exports"},"2819":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-12","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#usage","content":"Popover is a thin styled wrapper around Base UI Popover. The trigger is render-prop based — pass any element via render and the popover wires up open state, focus, and ARIA attributes automatically."},"2820":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-13","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#placement","content":"PopoverContent accepts side (top | right | bottom | left), align (start | center | end), and sideOffset props for positioning. Defaults are align='start', sideOffset=4."},"2821":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-14","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#rich-content","content":"The popup takes any content. Combine PopoverTitle and PopoverDescription with your own markup for profile cards and similar summaries."},"2822":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-15","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#multiple-triggers","content":"One Popover root can serve several triggers. Give each PopoverTrigger a payload, and render the content from the payload the root passes to its function child. The popup moves to whichever trigger opened it."},"2823":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-16","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#custom-anchor","content":"Pass anchor to position the popup against an element other than the trigger. A popover without a trigger, such as one opened from a menu item or a row action, needs it: control open yourself and point anchor at the element to align to. anchor accepts an element, a ref, a virtual element, or a function returning one."},"2824":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-17","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#portal-container","content":"PopoverContent portals to document.body by default. Pass portalContainer (an element or a ref) to render the popup inside another node instead."},"2825":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-18","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#portal-container","content":"Use it when the popover must stay inside a CSS-scoped root — styles under a scope selector do not apply if the popup is portaled to document.body. It is also useful when body portaling breaks stacking or clipping (Dialog, transform, fullscreen, Shadow DOM)."},"2826":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-19","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Need"},"2827":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-20","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Component"},"2828":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-21","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Short overlay with rich content"},"2829":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-22","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Popover"},"2830":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-23","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Action menu (each item fires a callback)"},"2831":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-24","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"DropdownMenu"},"2832":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-25","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Value picker (selection bound to a value)"},"2833":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-26","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Select / Combobox"},"2834":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-27","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Hierarchical path picker"},"2835":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-28","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Command + Popover"},"2836":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-29","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Searchable command palette"},"2837":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-30","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Command"},"2838":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-31","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#when-to-use","content":"Popover is the bare floating panel — pair it with your own content. For action menus, prefer DropdownMenu; for value pickers, prefer the matched component."},"2839":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-32","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"PopoverContent is a composite of Portal + Positioner + Popup. Positioning props are forwarded to the Positioner; the popup accepts the usual Base UI Popover Popup props."},"2840":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-33","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"Prop"},"2841":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-34","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"Type"},"2842":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-35","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"Default"},"2843":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-36","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"Description"},"2844":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-37","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"align"},"2845":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-38","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"'start' | 'center' | 'end'"},"2846":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-39","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"'start'"},"2847":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-40","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#popovercontent","content":"Alignment relative to the anchor"},"2848":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-41","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","t