-guide-202","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#樣式","content":"v0 元件依賴 styled-components。\nv1 元件使用 Tailwind CSS 4 utilities 與 Vittal Design 的 CSS 變數。"},"890":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-203","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#樣式","content":"不要從 npm 套件 import src-v2/styles/*。用 registry 安裝，讓主題寫進應用的 CSS。"},"891":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-204","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#清單","content":"ActionList 與 ActionInfiniteList 在 v1 已移除。依用途選替代："},"892":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-205","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#清單","content":"動作選單（每一項觸發 callback，沒有綁定值）→ DropdownMenu。"},"893":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-206","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#清單","content":"可搜尋的值選擇器 → Combobox。階層 → Command + Popover。"},"894":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-207","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#清單","content":"顯示列或明細清單 → Item + ItemGroup。選擇器密度用 size=\"list\"。"},"895":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-208","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#清單","content":"可搜尋的命令面板（搜尋、載入、分頁、空狀態文字由你管）→ Command。"},"896":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-209","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#treeselect","content":"把 TreeSelect 的畫面改成 Tree Select 區塊，它用 Command 與 Popover 組成。\n舊元件管了更多資料行為。在 v1，畫面自己管資料、載入狀態與子層載入；路徑與搜尋值由區塊持有，畫面需要更多行為時就直接修改區塊。"},"897":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-210","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#treeselect","content":"如果舊畫面只需要可搜尋的平面選項，改用 Combobox。"},"898":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-211","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#遷移檢查清單","content":"安裝 v1 的 registry 項目。"},"899":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-212","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#遷移檢查清單","content":"換掉畫面上的 @fed/vital-design import。"},"900":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-213","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#遷移檢查清單","content":"把 props 更新成 v1 的元件 API。"},"901":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-214","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#遷移檢查清單","content":"每個應用做一次 Tailwind 與主題設定。"},"902":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-215","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#遷移檢查清單","content":"測試選擇器、彈出層與列的鍵盤操作。"},"903":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-216","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#遷移檢查清單","content":"最後一個 v0 import 移除後，再拿掉 v0 的依賴。"},"904":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/tailwind-setup","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/tailwind-setup","type":"page","content":"Tailwind CSS 設定","breadcrumbs":["Docs","開始使用"